{
  "name": "Blog posts, pull quotes",
  "category": "blog",
  "description": "Each post introduced by a large pull quote, with its title and author underneath.",
  "tags": ["blog", "posts", "articles", "news", "quotes", "pull quote", "editorial", "bento"],
  "fieldGroups": ["Heading", "Button", "Posts"],
  "styleOverrides": [
    "--color-background",
    "--color-text",
    "--section-padding-y",
    "--color-surface"
  ],
  "fields": [
    {
      "name": "eyebrow",
      "label": "Eyebrow",
      "type": "text",
      "default": "From the journal",
      "group": "Heading"
    },
    {
      "name": "title",
      "label": "Title",
      "type": "text",
      "default": "Lines our readers keep quoting back to us",
      "group": "Heading",
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "name": "showButton",
      "label": "Show button",
      "type": "boolean",
      "default": true,
      "group": "Button"
    },
    {
      "name": "button",
      "label": "Button",
      "type": "button",
      "default": {
        "label": "Read the journal",
        "link": {
          "type": "url",
          "url": "#",
          "newTab": false
        },
        "variant": "secondary"
      },
      "visibleWhen": {
        "field": "showButton",
        "equals": true
      },
      "group": "Button"
    },
    {
      "name": "fromLabel",
      "label": "Label above titles",
      "type": "text",
      "default": "From",
      "group": "Posts"
    },
    {
      "name": "posts",
      "label": "Posts",
      "type": "list",
      "group": "Posts",
      "minItems": 1,
      "maxItems": 8,
      "itemLabel": "title",
      "itemFields": [
        {
          "name": "quote",
          "label": "Pull quote",
          "type": "textarea",
          "default": "One memorable line from the post."
        },
        {
          "name": "title",
          "label": "Post title",
          "type": "text",
          "default": "Post title"
        },
        {
          "name": "author",
          "label": "Author",
          "type": "text",
          "default": "Author name"
        },
        {
          "name": "date",
          "label": "Date",
          "type": "date",
          "default": "2026-09-01"
        },
        {
          "name": "link",
          "label": "Link",
          "type": "link",
          "default": {
            "type": "url",
            "url": "#",
            "newTab": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "default": [
        {
          "quote": "If you need a gift card to get someone on a call, they were never going to tell you the truth.",
          "title": "How to recruit customers for interviews",
          "author": "Ingrid Solberg",
          "date": "2026-09-29",
          "link": {
            "type": "url",
            "url": "#",
            "newTab": false
          }
        },
        {
          "quote": "Nobody remembers the day they cancelled. Everyone remembers the week they signed up.",
          "title": "The five-question churn interview",
          "author": "Daniel Novak",
          "date": "2026-07-14",
          "link": {
            "type": "url",
            "url": "#",
            "newTab": false
          }
        },
        {
          "quote": "A tag is a bookmark. A decision is a sentence with a name and a date next to it.",
          "title": "Tagging is not synthesis",
          "author": "Yuki Tanaka",
          "date": "2026-04-02",
          "link": {
            "type": "url",
            "url": "#",
            "newTab": false
          }
        },
        {
          "quote": "Two minutes of a real customer beats forty slides about them, every single time.",
          "title": "Highlight reels that change minds",
          "author": "Leila Haddad",
          "date": "2026-02-17",
          "link": {
            "type": "url",
            "url": "#",
            "newTab": false
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
